# Where the Glow+ NestJS backend lives. Mirrors the API_BASE_URL env var that
# glow-plus-frontend/server.js used to inject via its /config.js route.
# T49 — the base URL carries the API version; paths in api.js stay bare.
VITE_API_BASE_URL="http://localhost:4000/v1"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# "Continue with Google", by way of Supabase Auth.
#
# The SAME project the React Native app signs in against — see `extra` in
# `glow-plus-mobile app/app.json`. One project means one Google OAuth client
# and one consent screen, and it is what makes a customer who signed in on
# their phone and a customer who signed in on the site the same Glow+ account.
#
# BOTH ARE OPTIONAL. Left unset, the site simply does not show the button;
# email and password are unaffected. That is the intended state for any
# deployment that has not been through the dashboard setup below.
#
# The anon key is PUBLIC — it is what every Supabase web app ships in its
# bundle, and it grants only what Row Level Security allows, which for this
# project is nothing at all: the site never reads a Supabase table. Do not
# put the service-role key here.
#
# ⚠️ Supabase dashboard setup, without which the button appears and fails:
#
#   Authentication → Providers → Google        must be ENABLED, with the
#                                              Google Cloud OAuth client's ID
#                                              and secret.
#   Authentication → URL Configuration
#     · Site URL                               the production site
#     · Redirect URLs                          http://localhost:3000/**
#                                              https://<production domain>/**
#
# The `**` matters. Sign-in starts from three separate paths on this site
# (`/`, `/consumer/booking`, `/consumer/rewards`) and each is sent back to
# itself. Supabase silently redirects to the Site URL when `redirect_to` is
# not on the allow-list, which presents as "I signed in and nothing happened".
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
VITE_SUPABASE_URL="https://xhyoeiltwcciqowlwyov.supabase.co"
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY="sb_publishable_B8HpEIgPMihsQ_6Ges0tew_eMqEp55o"
